  "description": "A fully managed, cross-platform 2D image processing and font handling library for .NET. Supports BMP, GIF, JPEG, JPEG XL (JXL), PBM, PNG, TGA, TIFF, and WebP image formats, including JPEG XL lossy and lossless encoding and decoding, animation, HDR, and lossless JPEG to JPEG XL transcoding, plus image processing, filters, effects, drawing, text rendering, font handling, and image metadata.",
